  "description": "Lua io模块；\n快速开始：\n// 注册lua脚本语言\nScript.Langs.Set(\"lua\", LuaLang.Instance);\n// 语言环境中注册io模块\nLuaLang.Instance.AddModule(\"io\", new LuaIOModule());\n// 引入fs并调用相关方法\nstring s = @\"\nrequire 'io'\nlocal filePath = './test.txt'\nlocal f = io.open(filePath, 'w')\nf:write('hello')\nf:close()\nlocal f = io.open(filePath, 'r')\nlocal content = f:read()\nf:close()\n\";\nvar script = new Script();\nscript.Context.Langs = new[] { \"lua\" };\nscript.Eval(s);",
